    "年卡：一个月 9 卷，一卷最多 36 格。每月赠 3 张加急券。按年续订。" : {

    },
    "年卡已开，每月 9 卷" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yearly is on. 9 rolls a month"
          }
        },
